hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19680","Hushaym narrated to us, Husayn informed us from al-Shabi from Muhammad ibn Sayfi al-Ansari, he said: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) came out to us on the day of Ashura and said: Have you fasted this your day. Some said: Yes, and some said: No. He said: Then complete the rest of this your day, and ordered them to inform the people of the outskirts to complete that their day."
